  <h1>The <em>Double</em> Helix</h1>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <p class="sub">Deoxyribonucleic acid — two antiparallel sugar–phosphate strands, their bases
  paired across the axis: adenine with thymine, guanine with cytosine.</p>
